@title Cabinet: Auto-reconfigure is one preview and one undo step (1920x1080)
@area Cabinet
@sizes 1920x1080
# Where it lives: Arrange card of the Cabinet left rail (first row), Ctrl K "auto-reconfigure", plate right-click.
# K1 is dragged off its rail first so the chain has something to do. At 1920x1080 only K1 moves (Autogroup has nothing to change), so the Autogroup warning is only expected at 1366x768 where it moves 16 devices.
open qa/fixtures/cabinet-cooler-layout.novo
wait 20
click_text Cabinet #1
wait 30
shot before
drag 1098 337 1300 520
wait 10
shot k1-off-the-rail
key ctrl+k
wait 3
text auto-reconfigure
wait 4
shot palette
key Enter
wait 10
expect "Preview (Auto-reconfigure)"
expect "not a clearance check or a heat calculation"
expect "already has a duct"
shot reconfigure-preview
key Escape
wait 5
shot cancelled
key ctrl+k
wait 3
text auto-reconfigure
wait 4
key Enter
wait 10
key Enter
wait 10
shot reconfigure-accepted
check_layout
key ctrl+z
wait 10
shot reconfigure-undone
